docs {
  Requests for the free, public TVMaze API (https://www.tvmaze.com/api),
  used by the Show Explorer take-home assignment.

  No auth/API key required.

  Rate limit: ~20 requests per 10 seconds per IP. Exceeding it returns HTTP 429.

  See docs/02_tv_maze_api.md in the repo for full response shape examples.
}
